---
// src/components/PhilosophySection.astro
---

<section class="philosophy-section">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="content-col">
			<h2 class="title">Our Clinical Philosophy</h2>
			<p class="description">
				Refractive surgery is elective. That means every patient who
				walks through our door has a choice — and our job is to give you
				the information, candour, and care that lets you make the right
				one for you.
			</p>

			<blockquote class="quote">
				"We say no to procedures more often than most clinics. If we
				don't think laser eye surgery is the right option for you, we
				will tell you, and we will recommend an alternative — even if it
				means we don't perform the surgery."
			</blockquote>

			<p class="description">
				Our reputation depends on long-term outcomes, not short-term
				volume. We are doctors, not sales people. We are not employees
				and we have no "sales targets" or "quotas". We will give you an
				honest medical opinion as if you were our own family.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="assessment-col">
			<div class="assessment-card">
				<h3 class="assessment-title">The Focus Vision Assessment</h3>

				<div class="assessment-list">
					<div class="assessment-item">
						<span class="number">01</span>
						<div class="item-text">
							<h4>Listen first</h4>
							<p>
								What matters to you in your daily vision?
								Glasses-free swimming? Reading menus without
								readers? Driving at night without halos? Your
								goals shape your treatment plan.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="assessment-item">
						<span class="number">02</span>
						<div class="item-text">
							<h4>Measure thoroughly</h4>
							<p>
								A typical assessment includes corneal
								topography, OCT, biometry, pupillometry, and a
								comprehensive medical history review. We don't
								skip steps.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="assessment-item">
						<span class="number">03</span>
						<div class="item-text">
							<h4>Explain plainly</h4>
							<p>
								No jargon, no salespeak. We tell you what we'd
								do if you were our brother, sister, or parent.
								Just an honest medical opinion.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="assessment-item">
						<span class="number">04</span>
						<div class="item-text">
							<h4>Follow through</h4>
							<p>
								Post-operative care matters as much as the
								procedure itself. Every patient has direct
								contact with their surgeon during recovery.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.philosophy-section {
		background-color: #0f172a; /* Very dark navy */
		color: #ffffff;
		padding: 100px 24px;
	}

	.container {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 80px;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.content-col {
		text-align: left;
	}

	.title {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 32px 0;
		line-height: 1.1;
	}

	.description {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #cbd5e1;
		margin-bottom: 32px;
	}

	.quote {
		border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
		padding-left: 24px;
		margin: 40px 0;
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.assessment-card {
		background-color: #1e293b; /* Slightly lighter navy */
		border-radius: 40px;
		padding: 60px;
		text-align: left;
	}

	.assessment-title {
		color: #3b82f6;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 48px 0;
	}

	.assessment-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 40px;
	}

	.assessment-item {
		display: flex;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	.number {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: #ffffff;
		opacity: 0.1;
		line-height: 1;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		min-width: 60px;
	}

	.item-text h4 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin: 0 0 12px 0;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.item-text p {
		font-size: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
		color: #94a3b8;
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.container {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 60px;
		}

		.title {
			font-size: 2.5rem;
		}

		.assessment-card {
			padding: 40px;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.philosophy-section {
			padding: 60px 20px;
		}

		.assessment-card {
			padding: 30px 20px;
		}

		.number {
			font-size: 2rem;
			min-width: 45px;
		}
	}
</style>
